{
  "lesson_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02",
  "questions": [
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq01",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq01_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq01_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "State that variance is measured in squared units of the original data, whereas standard deviation is measured in the original units."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq01_p01_c02",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Explain that standard deviation is directly comparable to the mean and raw data because it shares the same linear scale and units."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq02",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq02_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq02_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Explain that standard deviation = 0 means there is zero spread, so every single notebook has a mass exactly equal to the mean (240 g)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq02_p01_c02",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate total mass = 6 * 240 = 1440 g."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq03",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq03_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq03_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate mean = 40 / 5 = 8."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq03_p01_c02",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate variance = (342 / 5) - 8^2 = 68.4 - 64 = 4.4."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq04",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq04_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq04_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate standard deviation = sqrt(4.4) = 2.10 (to 3 s.f.)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq04_p01_c02",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Explain that taking the square root prematurely (such as sqrt(sum(x^2)/n)) violates the order of operations because variance must be fully evaluated before square rooting."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq05",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq05_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq05_p01_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Set up products squaring the midpoints: 4 * (5^2) + 6 * (15^2)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq05_p01_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Evaluate: 4 * 25 + 6 * 225 = 100 + 1350 = 1450."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq06",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq06_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq06_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Explain that standard deviation of 0 dollars means all ticket prices are identical and equal to the mean of 18 dollars."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_drq06_p01_c02",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate cost of four tickets = 4 * 18 = 72 dollars."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01_p01_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate products: 2(5) + 5(15) + 3(25) = 10 + 75 + 75 = 160."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01_p01_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Divide by 10 to obtain estimated mean = 160 / 10 = 16."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01_p02",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01_p02_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate sum(fx^2) = 2(25) + 5(225) + 3(625) = 50 + 1125 + 1875 = 3050."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq01_p02_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate variance = (3050 / 10) - 16^2 = 305 - 256 = 49, so standard deviation = sqrt(49) = 7."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p01_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Sum the 4 scores: 6 + 8 + 10 + 12 = 36."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p01_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Divide by 4 to obtain mean = 36 / 4 = 9."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p02",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p02_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate sum(x^2) = 6^2 + 8^2 + 10^2 + 12^2 = 36 + 64 + 100 + 144 = 344."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p02_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate variance = (344 / 4) - 9^2 = 86 - 81 = 5."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq02_p02_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate standard deviation = sqrt(5) = 2.24 (to 3 s.f.)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p01",
          "marks": 2,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Identify midpoints: 15, 25, 40, 60."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p01_c02",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate sum(ft) = 4(15) + 8(25) + 6(40) + 2(60) = 620, so estimated mean = 620 / 20 = 31 minutes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p02",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p02_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate sum(ft^2) = 4(225) + 8(625) + 6(1600) + 2(3600) = 900 + 5000 + 9600 + 7200 = 22700."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p02_c02",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate estimated variance = (22700 / 20) - 31^2 = 1135 - 961 = 174."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq03_p02_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate estimated standard deviation = sqrt(174) = 13.19 = 13.2 minutes (3 s.f.)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p01",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p01_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Recover frequencies: 3, 9 - 3 = 6, 15 - 9 = 6, 20 - 15 = 5."
