              "text": "Identify midpoints: 5, 15, 30, 55."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p01_c03",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Calculate sum(fx) = 3(5) + 6(15) + 6(30) + 5(55) = 15 + 90 + 180 + 275 = 560, so estimated mean = 560 / 20 = 28."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p02",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p02_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate sum(fx^2) = 3(25) + 6(225) + 6(900) + 5(3025) = 75 + 1350 + 5400 + 15125 = 21950."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p02_c02",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate variance = (21950 / 20) - 28^2 = 1097.5 - 784 = 313.5."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq04_p02_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate standard deviation = sqrt(313.5) = 17.705... = 17.7 (3 s.f.)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq05",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l02_cpq05_p01",
